    <article id="recipe">

        <h2>Full Recipe: Chicken Biryani</h2>

        <h3>Ingredients</h3>

        <ul>
            <li>500 grams chicken</li>
            <li>2 cups basmati rice</li>
            <li>2 onions</li>
            <li>2 tomatoes</li>
            <li>1 cup curd</li>
            <li>Ginger garlic paste</li>
            <li>Biryani masala</li>
            <li>Salt as required</li>
            <li>Fresh coriander leaves</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Preparation Steps</h3>

        <ol>
            <li>Wash the rice properly and soak it in water.</li>

            <li>Clean the chicken and marinate it with curd,
            spices and ginger garlic paste.</li>

            <li>Heat oil in a pan and fry the onions.</li>

            <li>Add tomatoes and marinated chicken.</li>

            <li>Cook the chicken until it becomes tender.</li>

            <li>Boil the rice separately until it is partially cooked.</li>

            <li>Layer the rice over the chicken mixture.</li>

            <li>Cover the vessel and cook on low flame.</li>

            <li>Garnish with coriander leaves and serve hot.</li>
        </ol>

    </article>

